 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "A new issue comes in. The team asks who can take it. I learn about the HTTP request because it is useful. Now I understand the HTTP response. I write a short note about the assignee. Leo shows me how to assign an issue. During our chat, Maria says, \"Where is the check-in counter?\" I answer, \"I'd like an aisle seat.\" The team gives me good advice.",
   "tts": "A new issue comes in. The team asks who can take it. I learn about the H T T P request because it is useful. Now I understand the H T T P response. I write a short note about the assignee. Leo shows me how to assign an issue. During our chat, Maria says, \"Where is the check-in counter?\" I answer, \"I'd like an aisle seat.\" The team gives me good advice.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "一个新的问题单进来了。团队问谁能负责。我学习HTTP 请求，因为它很有用。现在我理解了HTTP 响应。我给负责人写了一条简短的笔记。Leo 教我怎样分配问题单。聊天时，Maria说：\"值机柜台在哪里？\"我回答：\"我想要靠过道的座位。\"团队给了我很好的建议。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "HTTP request",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "HTTP 请求，客户端发给服务器的网络消息"
    },
    {
     "w": "HTTP response",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "HTTP 响应，服务器返回给客户端的结果"
    },
    {
     "w": "Where is the check-in counter?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "值机柜台在哪里？"
    },
    {
     "w": "I'd like an aisle seat.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我想要靠过道的座位。"
    },
    {
     "w": "assignee",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "负责人，被指定处理事项的人"
    },
    {
     "w": "assign an issue",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "分配问题单，把事项交给某个人处理"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Leo goes to the airport. His flight is delayed. First Priya says, \"Where is the security check?\" then I reply, \"What gate is it?\" I write a short note about the status code. I ask one question about the request header. I mention a teammate one small step at a time. Maria explains the team mention to me. The day is busy, but I learn a lot.",
   "tts": "Leo goes to the airport. His flight is delayed. First Priya says, \"Where is the security check?\" then I reply, \"What gate is it?\" I write a short note about the status code. I ask one question about the request header. I mention a teammate one small step at a time. Maria explains the team mention to me. The day is busy, but I learn a lot.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "Leo 去机场。他的航班延误了。先是Priya说：\"安检在哪里？\"然后我回答：\"是哪个登机口？\"我给状态码写了一条简短的笔记。我问了一个关于请求头的问题。我一步一步地提及队友。Maria 给我讲解团队提及。这天很忙，但我学到了很多。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "status code",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "状态码，用数字表示请求处理结果"
    },
    {
     "w": "request header",
