    },
    {
     "w": "What gate is it?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "是哪个登机口？"
    },
    {
     "w": "mention a teammate",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "提及队友，用 @ 提醒某位成员"
    },
    {
     "w": "team mention",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "团队提及，用 @ 一次通知整个团队"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I finish one last task. I subscribe to an issue, and Maria checks it. I need to unsubscribe from updates before lunch. I write a short note about the response body. I ask one question about the GET request. During our chat, Maria says, \"The flight is delayed.\" I answer, \"Where can I collect my luggage?\" I take the issue. The team mentions me, and I see it.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I finish one last task. I subscribe to an issue, and Maria checks it. I need to unsubscribe from updates before lunch. I write a short note about the response body. I ask one question about the GET request. During our chat, Maria says, \"The flight is delayed.\" I answer, \"Where can I collect my luggage?\" I take the issue. The team mentions me, and I see it.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我完成最后一项任务。我订阅问题单，Maria 来检查。午饭前，我需要取消订阅更新。我给响应体写了一条简短的笔记。我问了一个关于GET 请求的问题。聊天时，Maria说：\"航班延误了。\"我回答：\"我在哪里取行李？\"我接下了这个问题单。团队提到了我，我看到了提醒。",
   "hard": [
